        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Hypertension – Therapy goal</title>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background-color: #050512;\n    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n  }\n  .slide {\n    width: 1024px;\n    height: 768px;\n    background: repeating-linear-gradient(\n      to bottom,\n      #05061a 0px,\n      #05061a 7px,\n      #0a0c2a 8px\n    ), linear-gradient(to bottom, #000000 0%, #0a0c2e 60%, #0a0c30 100%);\n    position: relative;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    padding: 40px 45px;\n  }\n  h1 {\n    color: #ffff33;\n    font-size: 46px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin: 0 0 10px 0;\n  }\n  .rule {\n    border: none;\n    border-top: 3px solid #cc2222;\n    margin: 0 0 40px 0;\n  }\n  .content {\n    margin-top: 20px;\n  }\n  .bullet1 {\n    color: #ffffff;\n    font-size: 32px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin: 0 0 8px 0;\n  }\n  .bullet1::before {\n    content: \"• \";\n    color: #ffffff;\n  }\n  .sub {\n    color: #6fa8dc;\n    font-size: 27px;\n    margin: 0 0 8px 55px;\n  }\n  .sub::before {\n    content: \"– \";\n  }\n  .spacer {\n    height: 40px;\n  }\n  .bottom-rule {\n    position: absolute;\n    bottom: 40px;\n    left: 30px;\n    right: 60px;\n    border: none;\n    border-top: 2px solid #cc2222;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"slide\">\n  <h1>Hypertension – Therapy goal</h1>\n  <hr class=\"rule\">\n\n  <div class=\"content\">\n    <p class=\"bullet1\">Goal BP</p>\n    <p class=\"sub\">To Keep B.P. &lt; 140/90 mm Hg in each patient</p>\n    <p class=\"sub\">This may be revised to 120/80&nbsp; may be ? 110/70</p>\n    <p class=\"sub\">MRFIT's&nbsp; cut off values are 115/75 mm Hg</p>\n\n    <div class=\"spacer\"></div>\n\n    <p class=\"bullet1\">The Truth is</p>\n    <p class=\"sub\">It is essential to keep the B.P at or below the goal</p>\n    <p class=\"sub\">But, It also matters how the goal B.P. is achieved !</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <hr class=\"bottom-rule\">\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
